  "body": "I'm writing the spec for `<meta name=color-scheme>` and copying the \"referer\" text, at Domenic's suggestion. The following terms used by \"referer\" aren't getting picked up properly by the autolinker, suggesting they need better dfn attributes:\r\n\r\n* the \"name\" attribute of `meta` (#attr-meta-name) (\"content\" is already marked up correctly)\r\n* \"the head element\" (#the-head-element-2) (just needs to be marked as exported)",
